     <article class="chapter-feature">
       <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
-        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 04</p>
-        <h2>AFK Agents</h2>
-        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Map autonomous work with PITER, trace a real AI Developer Workflow from issue to pull request, and learn the compounding discipline: fix the system, not the artifact.</p>
