The two-axis review found one substantive course-code drift the extract had missed: the review workflow tries to save screenshot URLs into ADW state, but the tracked state object silently drops that field. I’m correcting the teaching to show the intended handoff and the actual fallback path, and I’m tightening the prompt/type contract discussion plus two frame-backed Story moves before the final handoff.
