+- All 12 selected frames used exactly once, full-width up to 1100px, `object-fit: contain`, with descriptive alt text and timestamp captions: ✅
+- Hook → Picture → Story → Name → Worked example → You try → Fail/fix → Current Practice → Retrieval → Teach-back for all 10 ideas: ✅
