     <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tac-heading">
-      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume I</p><h2 id="tac-heading">Tactical Agentic Coding</h2></div><p>4 of 8 chapters · 50%</p></div>
