     <article class="chapter-feature">
       <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
-        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 04</p>
-        <h2>AFK Agents</h2>
-        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Map autonomous work with PITER, trace a real AI Developer Workflow from issue to pull request, and learn the compounding discipline: fix the system, not the artifact.</p>
-        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic #4 · Stay Out The Loop</li><li>90–150 min lab</li><li>12 course frames</li><li>2 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
-        <a class="button" href="vol-1-tac/04-afk-agents.html">Start chapter →</a>
+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 06</p>
+        <h2>Let Your Agents Focus</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Complete the SDLC with focused review and document agents, typed proof, bounded patch loops, and conditional memory that feeds the next plan.</p>
